{"id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-tuple-graph-code.md","title":"Tuple and Function-Graph Coding","display":"df-tuple-graph-code — Tuple and Function-Graph Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","aliases":["92-df-tuple-graph-code"],"display":"df-tuple-graph-code — Tuple and Function-Graph Coding","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-tuple-graph-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-tuple-graph-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tuple-graph-code — Tuple and Function-Graph Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Cantor pairing bijection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity and total function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\tau_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N},\\Gamma_k\">\\((\\tau_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N},\\Gamma_k\\)</span> (definition-target tuple encoders and graph-code constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_0&amp;:\\mathbb N^0\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\n\\tau_0(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{k+1}&amp;:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\n\\tau_{k+1}(n_1,\\ldots,n_{k+1})&amp;\\coloneqq\nJ\\bigl(\\tau_k(n_1,\\ldots,n_k),n_{k+1}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma_k(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{J(\\tau_k(\\vec n),f(\\vec n))\\mid\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec m,\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau_k(\\vec m)=\\tau_k(\\vec n)\\Longrightarrow\\vec m=\\vec n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_0&amp;:\\mathbb N^0\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\n\\tau_0(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{k+1}&amp;:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\n\\tau_{k+1}(n_1,\\ldots,n_{k+1})&amp;\\coloneqq\nJ\\bigl(\\tau_k(n_1,\\ldots,n_k),n_{k+1}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma_k(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{J(\\tau_k(\\vec n),f(\\vec n))\\mid\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec m,\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau_k(\\vec m)=\\tau_k(\\vec n)\\Longrightarrow\\vec m=\\vec n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k\">\\(\\tau_k\\)</span>：由同一个配对双射<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>递归生成的固定<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>时唯一空元组编码为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\)</span>：把输入元组编码与输出再次配对后得到的函数图码集</li>\n<li>最后一行由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>的单射性对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>归纳得到，保证图码不会把两个不同输入元组混同</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\)</span>是自然数集合，因而可作为本书集合型表示谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>的合法参数；这不等于把函数对象<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>直接送入集合谓词</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (Cantor pairing bijection, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\tau_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N},\\Gamma_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_0&:\\mathbb N^0\\to\\mathbb N,&\n\\tau_0(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{k+1}&:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N,&\n\\tau_{k+1}(n_1,\\ldots,n_{k+1})&\\coloneqq\nJ\\bigl(\\tau_k(n_1,\\ldots,n_k),n_{k+1}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma_k(f)&\\coloneqq\n\\{J(\\tau_k(\\vec n),f(\\vec n))\\mid\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec m,\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau_k(\\vec m)=\\tau_k(\\vec n)\\Longrightarrow\\vec m=\\vec n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_k","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1646,"backlinks":[{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_k(f)$ (paired graph-code set of a $k$-ary function, see [[92-df-tuple-graph-code]])"},{"id":"2d2cf287148220bf","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (encoded graph of $f$, see [[92-df-tuple-graph-code]])"},{"id":"04751f66804591ae","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_2$ (binary-function graph-code constructor, see [[92-df-tuple-graph-code]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]"}],"outgoing":["20fe67463d98fb92"]}